  // As long as the inner half-width between the side walls at the drop zone is > 0.0384 + 0.025 (marble radius) = 0.0634m!
  // WAIT A SECOND!
  // Read that again!
  // At t = 0, max transverse offset of the marble center is 0.0384m!
  // Plus the marble radius 0.025m = 0.0634m!
  // So if the channel inner half-width is 0.066m (inner width = 0.132m, outer width = 0.164m), and the walls at the drop zone reach y = 0.85m,
