  // Let's verify that!
  // Like shingles on a roof:
  // - Floor of Segment 1 (s = -0.14 to 0.50) ends slightly ABOVE Floor of Segment 2 (s = 0.48 to 1.12), so the marble drops down 2mm onto Segment 2 (never hits an upward floor lip!).
