  // - Side walls of Segment 3 sit at +/- 0.059m (2mm WIDER than Segment 2's walls at +/- 0.057m, and still only 0.118m wide inside, well within the 0.140m cup diameter!).
  // SHINGLED FLOORS + SHINGLED WALLS = ZERO LIPS ANYWHERE IN THE ENTIRE RUN!

  // Let's check the numbers for shingled floors and shingled walls!
  // Segment 1 (s = -0.15 to 0.52):
  // Floor center line from s = -0.15 (y = 0.64) to s = 0.52 (y = 0.455).
